    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer PATROL_PAUSE_AT_WAYPOINTS = 0;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PATROL_PAUSE_AT_WAYPOINTS has the value 0</p>
  <p>Option parameter for <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlPatrolPoints" target="_blank">llPatrolPoints</a> function. Can be set TRUE or FALSE (the default).</p>
  <p>When set TRUE, characters will slow down and momentarily pause at each waypoint.</p>
  <p>When set FALSE, characters will continue to move to the next waypoint at full speed, with no pause.</p>
</p>
    </div>

